1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,445
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,445 --> 00:00:04,817
The tapetum is nutritive, not protective.

3
00:00:04,817 --> 00:00:11,979
Protection is the epidermis, opening is the endothecium, and feeding the pollen is the tapetum.

4
00:00:11,979 --> 00:00:19,361
If the tapetum fails, the pollen is sterile: which is exactly how male sterile lines are made for hybrid seed.

